        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a world overrun by zombies, countless survivors hear a broadcast and set out in search of the legendary sanctuary: Eden.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3289550/extras/eaff8d93238053c518037b6c57e89ed5.avif?t=1759313441\" width=800 height=374 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And you are one of them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But the journey is always full of challenges and dangers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Various types of zombies stand in your way, yet beyond these known threats, even more unknown dangers await.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To survive, you must:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Move forward cautiously, making as little noise as possible. They lurk in the darkness.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3289550/extras/5fb858257e5a4579ec05bfe35cca65f0.avif?t=1759313441\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3289550/extras_big/5fb858257e5a4579ec05bfe35cca65f0.avif?t=1759313441 width=800 height=450 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather your teammates and fight together, striking back when enemies attack from all directions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3289550/extras/3e8717156fae633ba8cefdd39ed80dd0.avif?t=1759313441\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3289550/extras_big/3e8717156fae633ba8cefdd39ed80dd0.avif?t=1759313441 width=800 height=450 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect various items, such as grenades, firearms, and explosives. Using them at the right time can make your mission much easier.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3289550/extras/b488de8b91d0b832520d459098b91d87.avif?t=1759313441\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3289550/extras_big/b488de8b91d0b832520d459098b91d87.avif?t=1759313441 width=800 height=450 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rescue hostages, Search every single weapons and supplies you see. Every advantage brings more hope for survival.</p></li></ul>",
